    ← (Fama.stShape γF (Mole.garden_isMolecule a.prime.skeleton) a.totalSigma (mk a.prime)).child c i hnh]
  exact attCfp_member_iffLow a mk y hy hG J hcapA hcapY pat t s hrepUP (c.child i)


